---
import IndexLayout from "../layouts/index.astro";
import PhaseCardGrid from "../components/home/phase_card_grid.astro";
import HomeGate from "../components/home/home_gate.astro";
import { CINZA_PHASE_CARD_ORNAMENT } from "../data/card_ornaments.js";
// home_card_gate.css moved to layout-level for htmx-nav availability

const nigredo_card_visual = {
  ornament: CINZA_PHASE_CARD_ORNAMENT,
};

const phase_cards = [
  {
    phase_name: "Writing",
    phase_slug: "writing",
    phase_blurb:
      "Unhinged fragments of a broken psyche, and pieces trying to reach their becoming. A writer is my main aspiration, however far-fetched it might be.",
    visual_phase_slug: "nigredo",
    ...nigredo_card_visual,
  },
  {
    phase_name: "Work",
    phase_slug: "work",
    phase_blurb:
      "The things I have built for others: original tools, enormous systems, simple websites… the list grows every day.",
    visual_phase_slug: "citrinitas",
    ...nigredo_card_visual,
  },
  {
    phase_name: "About",
    phase_slug: "about",
    phase_blurb:
      "The creature tending this place, who Sol is, and how to find me.",
    visual_phase_slug: "rubedo",
    ...nigredo_card_visual,
  },
];
---

<IndexLayout
  page_title="Our Hearth"
  banner_title="Solarisael"
  hide_breadcrumbs={true}
>
  <HomeGate intro_body_class="sol__home_gate_body_hearth">
    <Fragment slot="intro">
        <p class="sol__home_intro_lead">
          Call me <span
            class="sol__text_fx"
            data-text-fx="glow aura"
            data-text-fx-glow-intensity="0.8"
            data-text-fx-aura-intensity="0.65">Sol</span
          >, and try to enjoy the five minutes you can linger before going back
          to <span
            class="sol__text_fx"
            data-text-fx="flicker"
            data-text-fx-flicker-intensity="0.55"
            data-text-fx-flicker-motion="0.2">doom-scrolling</span
          >.
        </p>
        <p class="sol__home_intro_aside">
          <span
            class="sol__text_fx"
            data-text-fx="glitch"
            data-text-fx-glitch-intensity="0.55"
            data-text-fx-glitch-motion="0.2"
          >
            (I don’t judge you, I’d do the same hehe~)
          </span>
        </p>

        <p class="sol__home_intro_line">
          I am… a <span
            class="sol__text_fx"
            data-text-fx="glitch"
            data-text-fx-glitch-intensity="1"
            data-text-fx-glitch-motion="0.2">nobody</span
          > above all else.
        </p>

        <p class="sol__home_intro_line">
          We must <span
            class="sol__text_fx"
            data-text-fx="flicker"
            data-text-fx-flicker-intensity="0.5"
            data-text-fx-flicker-motion="0.2">never forget</span
          > our <span
            class="sol__text_fx"
            data-text-fx="cadence_childlike"
            data-text-fx-cadence_childlike-intensity="1">origins</span
          > after all.
        </p>

        <p class="sol__home_intro_line">
          Many many years have I spent ignoring my <span
            class="sol__text_fx"
            data-text-fx="aura"
            data-text-fx-aura-intensity="1">reflection</span
          >…
        </p>

        <p class="sol__home_intro_line">
          It was like a <span
            class="sol__text_fx"
            data-text-fx="wiggle blur"
            data-text-fx-wiggle-intensity="0.5"
            data-text-fx-wiggle-motion="0.2"
            data-text-fx-blur-intensity="0.5">ghost</span
          >.
        </p>

        <p class="sol__home_intro_line">
          Insistently trying, <span
            class="sol__text_fx"
            data-text-fx="flicker glitch"
            data-text-fx-intensity="0.5"
            data-text-fx-motion="0.2">again</span
          > and <span
            class="sol__text_fx"
            data-text-fx="flicker glitch"
            data-text-fx-intensity="1"
            data-text-fx-motion="0.4">again</span
          >.
        </p>

        <p class="sol__home_intro_line">
          All it ever wanted was to <span
            class="sol__text_fx"
            data-text-fx="whisper"
            data-text-fx-whisper-intensity="1">warn</span
          > me.
        </p>

        <p class="sol__home_intro_line">
          To <span
            class="sol__text_fx"
            data-text-fx="cadence_oracular sigil_pulse"
            data-text-fx-cadence_oracular-intensity="3"
            data-text-fx-sigil_pulse-intensity="3"
            data-text-fx-sigil_pulse-motion="0.2">prevent</span
          > me from becoming a simple man with too many regrets to count.
        </p>

        <p class="sol__home_intro_line">
          This whole website is… a tiny… <span
            class="sol__text_fx"
            data-text-fx="glow"
            data-text-fx-glow-intensity="0.75"><strong>first step</strong></span
          >, let’s say. A public place to showcase everything that <span
            class="sol__text_fx"
            data-text-fx="cadence_childlike"
            data-text-fx-cadence_childlike-intensity="1"
            ><strong>I was</strong></span
          >, that <span
            class="sol__text_fx"
            data-text-fx="cadence_soft"
            data-text-fx-cadence_soft-intensity="1"><strong>I am</strong></span
          >, and <span
            class="sol__text_fx"
            data-text-fx="cadence_oracular"
            data-text-fx-cadence_oracular-intensity="1"
            ><strong>trying to be</strong></span
          >.
        </p>

        <p class="sol__home_intro_line">
          Consider this place a tiny grove for my <strong>work</strong>,
          <strong>thoughts</strong>, <strong>records</strong>,
          <strong>experiments</strong>, and the <span
            class="sol__text_fx"
            data-text-fx="veil whisper"
            data-text-fx-veil-intensity="0.65"
            data-text-fx-whisper-intensity="0.75"
            ><strong>strange things</strong></span
          > that never quite got to becoming.
        </p>

        <p class="sol__home_intro_line">
          I’d like it a lot if you critiqued my <strong>writing</strong>, in all
          its registers from <span
            class="sol__text_fx"
            data-text-fx="glitch shadow"
            data-text-fx-glitch-intensity="0.55"
            data-text-fx-glitch-motion="0.2"
            data-text-fx-shadow-intensity="0.5"><strong>unhinged</strong></span
          > to <span
            class="sol__text_fx"
            data-text-fx="etch"
            data-text-fx-etch-intensity="0.65"
            ><strong>somewhat palatable</strong></span
          >.
        </p>
    </Fragment>

    <Fragment slot="heading">Three Paths</Fragment>

    <PhaseCardGrid phase_cards={phase_cards} />
</HomeGate>
</IndexLayout>
